  "status": "pending",
  "updated_at": null,
  "notes": [
    "Written by the deploy and demo steps, read by judge/judge.mjs. Every null is something that has not happened yet.",
    "A claim in judge/claims.json that needs a null field is printed as SKIP (pending), never PASS.",
    "Set status to deployed only when every claim you keep is filled in: from then on the offline judge FAILS any claim without recorded evidence.",
    "Hashes are base58 (NEAR's encoding) unless the field name says hex. Amounts are decimal strings in the token's smallest unit (USDC has 6 decimals). yocto fields are yoctoNEAR.",
    "Two block heights pin the reads a judge must see the same way on any later day: verdicts.<payee>.read_block (get_verdict, whose DENY has a TTL) and demo.state_block (the vault's counters, which a later run would move). Record the block_height a view at finality final returned after the cited run; the same height may serve both."
  ],
